{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_st01",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_st01",
  "title": "荒地钟声",
  "storyCode": "FC-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2dd79a39006f751af1f2ca2b7323b8af9f0ee20d12bddf7ca1fc4ed2d6e4cd2c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "八年前\n1090年\n橡林郡"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风趣的贵族",
      "text": "伯爵阁下，不少人都在打听您，想要了解我们下一步的行动计划。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风趣的贵族",
      "text": "多亏了您的支持，我们的剧目大获成功。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风趣的贵族",
      "text": "塔拉人自己的剧院，塔拉人自己的历史，首场演出就有两百人前来观看，多么令人欢欣鼓舞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风趣的贵族",
      "text": "接下来，我们可以寻求与麦卡内尼男爵领地上的数家工厂合作，或者接受这几名银行家的联合邀约......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "这些事情请在宴会后再谈吧，珀斯爵士。或者，您交给一个打字员去安排，也不会出太多差错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "今天的宴会上，我们最好只谈论刚结束的演出，谈论塔拉的文明，抛下那些维多利亚人的繁文缛节和奔走钻营。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "各位，这些身份和礼仪，这些高雅的语句，我们赖以交流思想的体面词汇，全都是维多利亚人教给我们的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "这些东西就和维多利亚人的机器一样，让塔拉人的身心都染上了现代病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "原本我们只知道我们天性里的高洁与勇毅，我们那继承自盖尔王的血液只要听到战斗的号令就激动不已......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "但现在，我们学会了维多利亚人的精明与虚荣，以至于面对一项正确的事业，一种理想的感召，许多人却只能在其中进行利益的博弈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "不仅我们自身如此，我们在大街上时常看到的，小市民中的塔拉人，也是如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "他们因为沾染了维多利亚人的恶德，而变成矿石病人，变成无赖与暴徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风趣的贵族",
      "text": "您说得真好，伯爵阁下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "——抱歉，我失手打碎了酒杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "看来您的杯子有话要说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "我也想问问您的看法，伯爵阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "......原谅我这记性吧，请问您是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "威廉姆斯，诗人，今晚那一出戏剧的执笔人。但您不必费心记住我的名字，我在文坛还不能说有什么建树。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "威廉姆斯先生，别客气。我说过，我最不喜欢维多利亚人的繁文缛节。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "请问吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "......您将塔拉人比作染病之人，那您认为，我们要如何自愈？要怎么去救治其他塔拉人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "恐怕我们无论多么努力，都不能根治我们身上的疾病，就像已经浑浊的水不能再将自己洗净。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "所以您认为，那些无赖与暴徒，我们是不可能救助的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "您不相信他们其实缺少知识和教育，而我们的笔能够帮助他们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "唉，太过精致的知识正是我们的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "当然，我们写，我们呐喊，我们梦想一个塔拉的理想国......我们试图唤醒血脉中沉睡的，关于塔拉的记忆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "但你我将是不得不留在这个旧时代的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "您看，我很喜欢您的剧作，只是，我们都不得不使用维多利亚的语言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "“我放下战士的荣誉，只为以后塔拉的土地不必再被鲜血浸泡，德拉克的同族不必再刀剑相向。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "“除非有朝一日，红龙的火焰能令死去的战士从熔炉中复生。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的诗人",
      "text": "承蒙您的谬爱，这些只是民间歌谣的记录，我做的最多不过是音韵上的润色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "不，我只是在想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "塔拉未必不会再有下一条红龙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃里克伯爵",
      "text": "毕竟，如今我们谁也没见过德拉克，又怎么知道自己身边走过的人其实不是瓦伊凡呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1098年\n石高原野，红脊镇"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "找到了，在大街上活动的人就这两个。刚才砸碎窗户玻璃的声音一定是他们弄出来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "喂，你们俩老实点，不然下次绳子就不是套在你们的手腕上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "呸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "哎，你怎么还这么凶......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "对、对不起！军官老爷们！我们错了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "是通缉令上跟深池串通的那一批人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "有一个在通缉令上，另一个之前没见过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "呵，我就知道，这些塔拉人都是串通一气的，没几个好东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "哎呀！求您别动手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我们拿的东西就这些，您都已经搜出来了......您要问什么，我们一定老老实实交代......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "少废话。你们那些同伙呢？去哪儿了？去给深池通风报信了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "这、这个我真的不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我们根本没有什么同伙，也没见过深池的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你们不就是想随便抓几个人打死，给上面的贵族交差？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "呸！你们......你们这些维多利亚的混账东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "还嘴硬？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "带到屋子里去，别让这些恶棍在大街上闹，吵到其他人休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "先问那个挎着包的。他要是老实，就让他少受点苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我、我就是老实人啊，我什么都不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "等等，队长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "附近好像还有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "啊，那、那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "那个挎包的在叫什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "闭嘴，别想给你的同伴打掩护——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "——可是你们背后起火了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "......是库房那边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队长",
      "text": "*维多利亚粗口*，把一队的人叫起来！先救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "欸，他们把我们扔下啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "维恩，快帮我把绳子解了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我、我怎么帮你？我也被捆着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......快走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，明明没有你什么事，结果害得你跟我们一起逃跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......没事，我们甩掉那些人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "喂，维恩，收音机呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "在这儿，应该还能用，就是声音有点小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "声音小也好，免得被发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，你听听消息吧，我去水塘边洗把脸，冷静一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "那边的瓦伊凡，你如果觉得危险，可以先走。我给你指个路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "不用......我可以在这里等你们，帮你们放哨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......好，谢谢。你真是个好心人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "别紧张，维恩，别紧张。你看不见，你就不会害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "你摸到的不是血，真的不是血，就是沼泽地的泥巴，洗洗就干净了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......嘶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "见鬼......喂！这玩意真的还能用？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......求你小声点！当兵的肯定还没走远！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "多敲两下，再摇一摇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "......晚九点三十分左右......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "特伦特郡附近聚落发生纵火事件......手法与深池叛乱分子相似......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "......嫌疑人三名，仍在逃跑中......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "如有......深池叛乱分子线索，隐瞒不报者......视为与叛乱分子同罪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "......再次警告......熄火钟响后，禁止外出。矿场、工厂以外地区，禁止一切灯火......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "杜绝......一切与叛乱者勾结的活动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播的声音",
      "text": "（无信号的杂音）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "*塔拉粗口*。晚九点一过，真没有其他广播了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "这都是*塔拉粗口*的什么规矩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "......不好意思。我用塔拉语说脏话，你听得懂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "嗯......但没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "还是不好意思。把你这个外人卷进来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "没关系......塔拉人，在哪里都是一样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "以前，我也来过石高原野。不过，那时候还没有熄火钟的规定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哎，那你应该是住在移动城市上面的人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "这个敲钟的规矩，本来也有许多年啦，只有荒野上才听得到，用来管着那些半夜偷偷钻进什么伯爵什么子爵的猎场打猎的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "钟声一响，我们就把灯熄了，火也灭了。这时候荒野上如果有人点火把驱赶野兽，隔着老远就能看得清清楚楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "只是新规定变严了，才有今天这样的麻烦事。那些半夜巡逻的家伙，在街上看到一个就抓一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哎，维恩，你冷静啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "算是吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......呃，我们的药呢？是不是一点没剩下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你说呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......唉。可惜了我的钢笔，现在我连账都没法记了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "咱们就是去抢的，你就不该想着拿自己的东西去抵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "咱们出来多少天了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "要是还没过午夜，这是第十二天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "好吧。十二天了，咱们根本没走多远。我总觉得要是天气放晴，我还能看见村子的炊烟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我们就这么被当兵的追着，在这一带兜圈子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "你说，我们真的能逃出去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......你们遇到什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我们跟巡逻队起了点冲突，被通缉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "维恩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "让我说吧，费加尔，我感觉得出来，这位女士是个好心人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "当时巡逻队来我们这里抓人，把犯过事的人都叫出来了。然后他们动手打人，我们就打回去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你没打，维恩。别给自己邀功。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "呃，好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "其实我们也没犯多大事，有家人交不上税金跑了，巡逻队揪着他们的亲戚问情况。费加尔是酿了点自己喝的酒，我是卖东西的手续不齐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，以往大家都是老老实实认错的，那天没忍住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "跟巡逻队打起来之后，跑出来的也不止我们两个。我们有十几个人，但凡那天被当兵的叫到名字的，都一起跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "一旦那些当兵的想抓人，谁都逃不掉。我们靠一张嘴说自己清白，他们是不会信的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "你们打死了人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "是，我们干倒了两个，一个是一开始趁他们没防备用锄头砸倒的，另一个是混战里趁机放倒的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "可惜，还是让剩下那个跑了，不然当兵的哪知道我们干了什么事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉！要是能多一夜的时间逃走，我们都不会这么惨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......费加尔，我们有没有可能，去跟当兵的自首？我自己去自首也行。这逃亡的日子我撑不下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "咱们没弄到药，只能看着奥兰的伤口慢慢烂掉，人也......我受不了这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你别想着什么自首，你以为当兵的会给你个痛快？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "才不会。他们会先折磨你，威胁你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你这种人呢，只要两分钟，就会把我们的事情全说出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，可咱们没有药，被伤病折磨，不也一样是折磨吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......你们，很缺药？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "哈哈......我们确实是被其他人派来弄点药的，他们还在挺远的地方等着我们呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "本来是来买药的，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "但咱们心里都知道，熄火钟一敲，商铺都会关门。我们肯定来不及在钟声响起之前赶到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "所以我们估计了一下巡逻队的换班时间，呃，砸了药铺的窗户玻璃......我还以为那个时候他们注意不到呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......算啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......你呢，你像是城市里来的，为什么要跑到这么荒凉的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......我在找一些东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "你们，了解“深池”吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......嗯，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "止血剂和绷带，我其实带了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "维恩先生，我看见你受伤了......处理一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，被你发现了？其实也不是大事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "不过，你愿意分我一点药品的话，那就太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我们的同伴伤得很重，我想带给他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......呃，被钳兽咬的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "那，我可以跟你们一起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "那边！泥巴上有脚印，往那个方向去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "那几个放火的塔拉渣滓！一定在附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "——快、快躲起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "有......一整队，半打人，手电往这边照过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "快点，弯下腰，这边走！这里的地是实的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "没关系的......那些士兵在沼泽地也不敢走得太快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "——嘘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "（维恩，我都能听到你牙齿在打战！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "（我......唔......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "手电向他们照了过来。\n苇草握紧手中的长枪，金属不断升温。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵？",
      "text": "嘁！凭什么你们能打手电！看着就来气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "深池？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "抓住她！她身上一定能挖出情报！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵？",
      "text": "抓我？想都别想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "呸！怎么扔泥巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "走，维恩，我们得去帮她！别当胆小鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "哎，哎，好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻队队员",
      "text": "呃——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵？",
      "text": "哈，这几个新兵，处理起来不费什么劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵？",
      "text": "喂，维恩，费加尔！你们到底把事情办成什么样子了？要是我不出来找你们，你们是不是得死在这儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，是啊。多亏了你，捡回一条命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "我早就跟你说了，这种打砸抢烧的事我可能做不好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......等等，塞尔蒙，你要干什么？把他们打昏过去就够了，你难道还要全都杀了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "那样的话，咱们身上的罪名得多重？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "有什么区别？只要他们想抓塔拉人，罪名轻重都无所谓，抓到了人，他们就不会活着放走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "唉，可是自己心里轻重还是有区别的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "胆小鬼。你看好了，我就是要把这些维多利亚的混账——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......住手。别这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "你又是什么人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "哈，盯着我干嘛？准备打小报告？试试看啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "举报？不，你根本不是深池的人。为什么......要穿成这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "为什么要模仿鬼魂部队的做事方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "——你凭什么这么说？你很了解深池？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "呃，冷静点，塞尔蒙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "她只是个医生，刚刚跟我们一起逃出来的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "......我觉得她是个好人。我把我们的事情都告诉她了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "对，那个，医生......你说跟我们一起去看看伤员的事，还作数吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "text": "塞尔蒙，你真的得冷静点......我们把事情搞砸了，没拿到药。这位好心的医生说她能帮我们，现在我们只能靠她了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "text": "......嘁，我说了不算。是这位医生看起来认识我这身衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "text": "......抱歉，我不是医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
